<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Vidyasagar_(composer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Vidyasagar** (born 2 March 1963) is an Indian composer, musician and singer who works predominantly in the [Tamil](:Tamil_cinema), [Malayalam](:Malayalam_cinema), and [Telugu](:Telugu_cinema) film industries. After working with several composers as assistant and conductor, Vidyasagar made his debut as a film composer in the 1989 Tamil film *[Poo Manam](:Poo_Manam)* and nicknamed as Melody King Working for over 225 feature films, he is the recipient of the [National Award](:National_Film_Awards) and five [Filmfare Awards](:Filmfare_Award_for_Best_Music_Director_%28Malayalam%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
