<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Megabox_(cinema_chain)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Megabox Joongang (Hangeul: 메가박스중앙(주); stylized as MEGABOX (메가박스)) is a multiplex cinema chain in South Korea, and the third largest multiplex theater company in the country, after CJ CGV and Lotte Cinema. It is headquartered in Cheongdam-dong, Gangnam-gu, Seoul. It was established in 2000 as a subsidiary of Orion Confectionery. It later merged with Cinus, owned by JoongAng Group's Media Network, in 2010. Currently, it operates 722 screens at 105 locations nationwide."@en .
