<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sylvia_Chang> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sylvia Chang Ai-chia (Chinese: 張艾嘉; pinyin: Zhāng Àijiā; born 21 July 1953) is a Taiwanese actress, writer, singer, producer and director. In 1992, she was a member of the jury at the 42nd Berlin International Film Festival. In 2018, she was one of the jury members of the main competition section at the 75th Venice International Film Festival."@en .
