<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Wonderful_Nightmare> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Wonderful Nightmare (Korean: 미쓰 와이프; RR: Misseu Waipeu; lit. Miss Wife) is a 2015 South Korean romantic comedy film starring Uhm Jung-hwa and Song Seung-heon. The early Korean working title literally translates to Wonderful Nightmare (Korean: 멋진 악몽; RR: Meotjin Akmong), which was retained for the international English title."@en .
