<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Amor_e_Dedinhos_de_Pé> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Amor e Dedinhos de Pé*** (literally: 'Love and Tiny Toes'; Template:Lang-es; Template:Lang-fr is a 1992 [Portuguese-language](:European_Portuguese) [Portuguese](:Cinema_of_Portugal)-[French](:Cinema_of_France)-[Spanish](:Cinema_of_Spain) film of [romantic drama](:Romance_film%23Romantic_drama) genre, directed and written by [Luís Filipe Rocha](:Lu%C3%ADs_Filipe_Rocha) and [Izaías Almada](:Iza%C3%ADas_Almada), and starring [Joaquim de Almeida](:Joaquim_de_Almeida), [Ana Torrent](:Ana_Torrent) and [Jean-Pierre Cassel](:Jean-Pierre_Cassel). It is based on the novel *Amor e Dedinhos de Pé: Romance de Macau* by the [Macanese](:Macanese_people) writer [Henrique de Senna Fernandes](:Henrique_de_Senna_Fernandes). The film was premiered in [Macau](:Portuguese_Macau) on 20 March 1992, and was released in [France](:France) on 21 October of the same year. In [Portugal](:Portugal) it was released on 15 January 1993, and in [Spain](:Spain) on 6 August of the same year."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
