<http://dbpedia.org/resource/María_Martín_(actress)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "María Martín (14 July 1923 – 10 June 2014) was a Spanish actress. After making her screen debut in 1943, Martín appeared in around eighty films during her career including Dawn of America (1951) and (1978.) She was occasionally credited as \"Mary Martin\" in English-speaking films. Martín died in Barcelona on 10 June 2014, at the age of 90."@en .
