<http://dbpedia.org/resource/John_Quested_(producer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "John Quested (born 1935) has been the owner and chairman of Goldcrest Films since the early 1990s. He began his career as a third assistant director on The Concrete Jungle in 1960 and has gone on to produce many feature films over the course of his career."@en .
