<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jeffrey_Dean_Morgan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Jeffrey Dean Morgan (born April 22, 1966) is an American actor of television and film, best known for playing the character Negan in the AMC horror drama series The Walking Dead (2016–present), for which he has received critical acclaim. He has also appeared in such television roles as John Winchester in the CW fantasy horror series Supernatural (2005–2007; 2019), Denny Duquette in the ABC medical drama series Grey's Anatomy (2006–2009), and Jason Crouse in the CBS political drama series The Good Wife (2015–2016), the Comedian in the superhero film Watchmen (2009), as well as film roles including Clay in The Losers (2010), Sgt. Andrew Tanner in Red Dawn (2012), and Agent Harvey Russell in Rampage (2018)."@en .
