<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Rajendra_Prasad_(actor)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gadde Rajendra Prasad (born 19 July 1958) is an Indian actor who predominantly works in Telugu films. He is a recipient of four Andhra Pradesh state Nandi Awards, three SIIMA Awards, and three Santosham Film Awards. He is fondly called \"Nata Kireeti\" and he has been honored with the title \"Hasya Kireeti\" by the Telugu Alliances of Canada, held at Mississauga. He was also honored to walk the green carpet at the IIFA film festival held in 2009, marking his performance in the English-language film, Quick Gun Murugun."@en .
