<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Raman_(film)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Raman*** (English: *Travelogue of Invasion*) is a 2008 [Malayalam](:Malayalam) film written and directed by Dr. Biju. A controversial and much debated-over socio-political film, it shows two variants of invasion by [imperialist](:Imperialism) forces—of [Iraq](:Iraq) and [Kerala](:Kerala). The film was an official selection for eight international film festivals including the prestigious [Cairo International Film Festival](:Cairo_International_Film_Festival).According to the director, the film \"shows how economic, cultural and military invasion by the U.S. ends up annihilating third-world countries like India and Iraq.\" [George W. Bush](:George_W%2E_Bush) has been described as a \"political terrorist\" in the film."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
