<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bob_Alcivar> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Bob Alcivar** (born July 8, 1938, in [Chicago, Illinois](:Chicago%2C_Illinois%29) is an American [music producer](:Music_producer), [composer](:Composer), [conductor](:Conducting) and [keyboard](:Keyboard_instrument) player. He is the father of [rock](:Rock_music) keyboard player [Jim Alcivar](:Jim_Alcivar) ([Montrose](:Montrose_%28band%29), [Gamma](:Gamma_%28band%29))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
