<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Barry_Peterson_(cinematographer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Barry Peterson is a Canadian-American cinematographer. Born in Alberta, Canada, Peterson initially worked in special visual effects on various productions before moving into live action cinematography, where he began shooting commercials for companies such as Apple, Pepsi and Nike. Peterson is father to two sons. One of his sons, Cole, is in an open relationship with a man named Nick. In television, Peterson worked on the pilot episodes of the series The Cape, Brooklyn Nine-Nine and The Good Place."@en .
