<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Pradeep_Nair> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pradeep Nair is an Indian film maker from Kerala. He is known for producing feature films and documentaries. His featured film, Oridam has fetched him 9 awards including a National and State. Oridam is also selected to Indian panorama and more than other 15 International Film Festivals all over the world. He also received a Special Jury Award in Direction in 52nd National Film Award of India and 5 awards in direction, actress, music, costume design, film processing from the 35th Kerala State Film Awards."@en .
