<http://dbpedia.org/resource/R._Muthuraman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Muthuraman Radhakrishnan** (4 July 1929 – 16 October 1981) was an Indian actor who predominantly appeared in [Tamil language](:Tamil_language) films. He was a leading actor during the 1960s and 1970s and was fondly called as *Navarasa Thilagam*. He had paired with all the leading heroines of his time and acted in over a hundred films. Muthuraman's son [Karthik](:Karthik_%28actor%29) is also a popular Tamil actor and politician, and his grandson [Gautham Karthik](:Gautham_Karthik) is also an actor who made his debut in *[Kadal](:Kadal_%282013_film%29)* (2013)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
