<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cliff_Martinez> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Cliff Martinez** (born February 5, 1954) is an American musician and composer. Early in his career, Martinez was known as a drummer notably with the [Red Hot Chili Peppers](:Red_Hot_Chili_Peppers) and [Captain Beefheart](:Captain_Beefheart). Since the 1990s, he has worked primarily as a [film score](:Film_score) composer, writing music for *[Spring Breakers](:Spring_Breakers)*, *[The Foreigner](:The_Foreigner_%282017_film%29)*, and multiple films by [Steven Soderbergh](:Steven_Soderbergh) (*[Sex, Lies, and Videotape](:Sex%2C_Lies%2C_and_Videotape)*, *[Solaris](:Solaris_%282002_film%29)*, *[Contagion](:Contagion_%282011_film%29)*, and *[Traffic](:Traffic_%282000_film%29)*) and [Nicolas Winding Refn](:Nicolas_Winding_Refn) (*[Drive](:Drive_%282011_film%29)*, *[Only God Forgives](:Only_God_Forgives),* *[The Neon Demon](:The_Neon_Demon)* and the miniseries *[Too Old to Die Young](:Too_Old_to_Die_Young)*).On April 14, 2012, Martinez was inducted into the [Rock and Roll Hall of Fame](:Rock_and_Roll_Hall_of_Fame) as a member of the Red Hot Chili Peppers."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
