<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Billy_Bletcher> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**William Bletcher** (September 24, 1894 – January 5, 1979) was an American actor. He was known for voice roles for various classic animated characters, most notably [Pete](:Pete_%28Disney%29) in [Walt Disney](:Walt_Disney)'s [Mickey Mouse](:Mickey_Mouse) short films and the [Big Bad Wolf](:Big_Bad_Wolf%23Disney_version) in Disney's *[Three Little Pigs](:Three_Little_Pigs_%28film%29)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
