<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Charlie_Bit_My_Finger> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\"Charlie bit my finger - again !\", more simply known as \"Charlie Bit My Finger\" or \"Charlie Bit Me\", was a 2007 internet viral video famous for being at the time the most viewed YouTube video. As of July 2021, the video received over 886 million views. In May 2021, the video was sold as an NFT at auction for over $700,000. On 24 May, the video was set to Unlisted. The Charlie Bit Me \"Official Remix\" and \"Working With Harry and Charlie\" NFTs were auctioned off in May 2021."@en .
