<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Verónica_Castro> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Verónica Castro** (Template:IPA-es, full name **Verónica Judith Sáinz Castro** (born 19 October 1952), is a Mexican actress, singer, producer, former model and presenter.She started her career as a television actress, where she met comedian [Manuel Valdés](:Manuel_Vald%C3%A9s), father of her son [Cristian Castro](:Cristian_Castro), and in [fotonovelas](:Fotonovela) and [telenovelas](:Telenovela) while earning her degree in [international relations](:International_relations)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
