<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jon_Harris_(film_editor)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Jon Harris** (born 11 July 1967) is a British [film editor](:Film_editor) known for his work on *[Snatch](:Snatch_%28film%29)* (2000), *[Layer Cake](:Layer_Cake_%28film%29)* (2004), *[The Descent](:The_Descent)* (2005), *[Stardust](:Stardust_%282007_film%29)* (2007), *[127 Hours](:127_Hours)* (2010), *[The Woman in Black](:The_Woman_in_Black_%282012_film%29)* (2012), *[The Two Faces of January](:The_Two_Faces_of_January_%28film%29)* (2014), *[T2 Trainspotting](:T2_Trainspotting)* (2017), *[McMafia](:McMafia)* (2018), *[Yesterday](:Yesterday_%282019_film%29)* (2019) and *[The Dig](:The_Dig_%282021_film%29)* (2021).He was nominated for an [Academy Award for Best Film Editing](:Academy_Award_for_Best_Film_Editing) for *127 Hours*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
