<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Blonde_Savage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Blonde Savage*** is a 1947 American [adventure film](:Adventure_film) directed by [Steve Sekely](:Steve_Sekely) and written by Gordon Bache. The film stars [Leif Erickson](:Leif_Erickson_%28actor%29), [Gale Sherwood](:Gale_Sherwood), [Veda Ann Borg](:Veda_Ann_Borg), [Douglass Dumbrille](:Douglass_Dumbrille), [Frank Jenks](:Frank_Jenks), and Matt Willis. It was released on November 22, 1947 by [Producers Releasing Corporation](:Producers_Releasing_Corporation)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
