<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Paul_Landres> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Paul Landres (1912–2001) was an American film and television editor and director. He directed episodes of The Lone Ranger, Maverick and Flipper, among many other TV series. He directed the vampire film The Return of Dracula (1958) based on Pat Fiedler's script and starring Ray Stricklyn, Virginia Vincent, John Wengraf, Gage Clarke, Jimmy Baird and Greta Granstedt. He met actor Arthur Franz and actress Kathleen Crowley and both appeared in The Flame Barrier (1958)."@en .
