<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Borhane_Alaouié> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Borhane Alaouié** (1 April 1941 – 9 September 2021) was a Lebanese [film director](:Film_director). He directed ten films since 1975. His debut film *[Kafr kasem](:Kafr_kasem)* was entered into the [9th Moscow International Film Festival](:9th_Moscow_International_Film_Festival) where it won a Diploma. His 1981 film *[Beyroutou el lika](:Beyroutou_el_lika)* was entered into the [32nd Berlin International Film Festival](:32nd_Berlin_International_Film_Festival)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
