<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jane_Eyre_(2011_film)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Jane Eyre*** is a 2011 [romantic](:Romance_film) [drama film](:Drama_film) directed by [Cary Fukunaga](:Cary_Fukunaga) and starring [Mia Wasikowska](:Mia_Wasikowska) and [Michael Fassbender](:Michael_Fassbender). The screenplay is written by [Moira Buffini](:Moira_Buffini) based on [Charlotte Brontë](:Charlotte_Bront%C3%AB)'s [1847 novel of the same name](:Jane_Eyre), a classic of the [Gothic](:Gothic_fiction), [bildungsroman](:Bildungsroman), and [romance](:Romance_novel) genres.The film was released on 11 March 2011 in the United States and 9 September in Great Britain and Ireland. It received positive reviews from critics. The film's costume design, led by [Michael O'Connor](:Michael_O%27Connor_%28costume_designer%29), was nominated for an [Academy Award](:Academy_Award_for_Best_Costume_Design)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
