<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ivan_Reitman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ivan Reitman OC ( /ˈraɪtmən/; October 27, 1946 – February 12, 2022) was a Czechoslovak-born Canadian film and television director, producer and screenwriter. He was best known for his comedy work, especially in the 1980s and 1990s. He was the owner of The Montecito Picture Company, founded in 1998. Films he directed include Meatballs (1979), Stripes (1981), Ghostbusters (1984), Ghostbusters II (1989), Twins (1988), Kindergarten Cop (1990), Dave (1993), and Junior (1994). Reitman also served as producer for such films as Animal House (1978), Space Jam (1996), and Private Parts (1997)."@en .
