<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kafr_kasem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kafr kasem is a 1975 Syrian drama film directed by Borhane Alaouié. It was entered into the 9th Moscow International Film Festival where it won a Diploma. The subject of the film is the Kafr Qasim massacre that occurred in Israel in 1956."@en .
