<http://dbpedia.org/resource/William_Wauer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "William Wauer (1866–1962) was a German sculptor and film director of the silent era. In 1913 he co-directed the biopic (1913). In 1915 he directed The Tunnel the first adaptation of Bernhard Kellermann's science fiction novel Der Tunnel. His birthplace is now the Wauer Museum."@en .
