<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Chakri_(composer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Gilla** **Chakradhar** (15 June 1974 – 15 December 2014), known professionally as **Chakri**, was an Indian [music composer](:Music_Composer) and [singer](:Singer) who worked in [Telugu cinema](:Telugu_cinema). He won the [Filmfare Award for Best Male Playback Singer – Telugu](:Filmfare_Award_for_Best_Male_Playback_Singer_%E2%80%93_Telugu) for *[Satyam](:Satyam_%282003_film%29)* (2003) & [Nandi Award for Best Music Director](:Nandi_Award_for_Best_Music_Director) for [Simha](:Simha_%28film%29) (2010)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
