<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Natalie_Mendoza> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Natalie Jackson Mendoza (born 12 August 1976) is an Australian-British actress, singer, and dancer. She is best known for her roles as one of the main characters, Jackie Clunes, in the British drama series Hotel Babylon (2006–2008) and as Juno in the horror film The Descent (2005), as well as its sequel, The Descent Part 2 (2009). Mendoza has also performed in various stage productions across the West End and Broadway, including Miss Saigon (role of \"Gigi\"), Here Lies Love (\"Imelda Marcos\"), and Spider-Man: Turn Off The Dark (\"Arachne\")."@en .
