<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Frank_Borzage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Frank Borzage (/bɔːrˈzeɪɡi/; April 23, 1894 – June 19, 1962) was an Academy Award-winning American film director and actor, known for directing 7th Heaven (1927), Street Angel (1928), Bad Girl (1931), A Farewell to Arms (1932), Man's Castle (1933), History Is Made at Night (1937), The Mortal Storm (1940) and Moonrise (1948)."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Vennira_Aadai_Nirmala> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Vennira Aadai Nirmala (born as A. B. Shanthi in Kumbakonam) is an Indian actress who has appeared in Tamil, Malayalam and Telugu films. She was a prominent lead actress from 1960s and 70s. She is credited as Ushakumari in Malayalam film industry."@en .
