<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jean-Pierre_Cassel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Jean-Pierre Cassel (born Jean-Pierre Crochon; 27 October 1932 – 19 April 2007) was a French actor and dancer. A popular star of French cinema, he was initially known for his comedy film appearances, though he also proved a gifted dramatic actor, and accrued over 200 film and television credits in a career spanning over 50 years. Cassel was the father of actor Vincent Cassel, actress/singer Cécile Cassel, and rapper Mathias Cassel."@en .
