<http://dbpedia.org/resource/The_Strong_Man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***The Strong Man*** is a 1926 American silent comedy film starring Harry Langdon.Along with *[Tramp, Tramp, Tramp](:Tramp%2C_Tramp%2C_Tramp)*, *The Strong Man* is Langdon's best known film. Capra would also direct Langdon's next feature, *[Long Pants](:Long_Pants)* (1927), which would be their final collaboration."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
