<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Osvaldo_Valenti> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Osvaldo Valenti** (17 February 1906 – 30 April 1945) was an Italian film actor. He appeared in more than 50 films between 1928 and 1945. He was born in [Istanbul](:Istanbul), Turkey to a Sicilian carpet trader and a wealthy Lebanese woman of Greek descent. He and his lover, [Luisa Ferida](:Luisa_Ferida), were executed by [partisans](:Italian_Resistence) in [Milan](:Milan), Italy, due to their links with [Fascism](:Fascism). Their story was portrayed in the 2008 film *[Wild Blood](:Wild_Blood_%282008_film%29)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
