<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mircea_Monroe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Mircea Monroe** (born March 11, 1982) is an American model and actress, known for her roles on the TV series *[Episodes](:Episodes_%28TV_series%29)* as Morning Randolph (2011–2017), *[Hart of Dixie](:Hart_of_Dixie)* as Tansy Truitt (2011–2015), *[Impastor](:Impastor)* as Alexa Cummings (2015–2016) and *[Sing It!](:Sing_It%21)* as Stacey Needles (2016). She has also performed in films including *[Cellular](:Cellular_%28film%29)* (2004), *[House of the Dead 2](:House_of_the_Dead_2_%28film%29)* (2005), *[Just Friends](:Just_Friends)* (2005), *[The Change-Up](:The_Change-Up)* (2011) and *[Magic Mike](:Magic_Mike)* (2012)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
