<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gashmeer_Mahajani> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gashmeer Mahajani (born 8 June 1985) is an Indian Film, Television Actor, Dance Choreographer and Play Director. He is better known for his work in Marathi cinema. He is the son of veteran Marathi film actor Ravindra Mahajani. Gashmeer debuted with P. Som Shekar's Hindi film Muskurake Dekh Zara (2010), although only in 2015 did he achieve popularity, when Carry On Maratha, which was his Marathi film debut and Deool Band were released."@en .
