<http://dbpedia.org/resource/William_Sadler_(actor)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**William Thomas Sadler** (born April 13, 1950) is an American stage, film, and television actor. His television and motion picture roles have included [Chesty Puller](:Chesty_Puller) in *[The Pacific](:The_Pacific_%28miniseries%29)*, [Luther Sloan](:List_of_recurring_Star_Trek%3A_Deep_Space_Nine_characters%23Sloan%2C_Luther) in *[Star Trek: Deep Space Nine](:Star_Trek%3A_Deep_Space_Nine)*, [Sheriff Jim Valenti](:Sheriff_Jim_Valenti) in *[Roswell](:Roswell_%28TV_series%29)*, convict Heywood in *[The Shawshank Redemption](:The_Shawshank_Redemption)*, Senator Vernon Trent in *[Hard to Kill](:Hard_to_Kill)*, [Death](:Death_%28personification%29) in *[Bill & Ted's Bogus Journey](:Bill_%26_Ted%27s_Bogus_Journey)* and *[Bill & Ted Face the Music](:Bill_%26_Ted_Face_the_Music)*, and Colonel Stuart in *[Die Hard 2](:Die_Hard_2)*. He played [Matthew Ellis](:Matthew_Ellis) in *[Iron Man 3](:Iron_Man_3)*, *[Marvel's Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.](:Marvel%27s_Agents_of_S%2EH%2EI%2EE%2EL%2ED%2E)*, and *[WHIH Newsfront](:WHIH_Newsfront)*. He also recurs as [John McGarrett](:List_of_Hawaii_Five-0_%282010_TV_series)_characters#John_McGarrett) in the [2010 remake](:Hawaii_Five-0_%282010_TV_series%29) of the 1968 television series *[Hawaii Five-O](:Hawaii_Five-O_%281968_TV_series%29)*, and the Boston boxing promoter and suspected drug dealer Gino Fish in the [Jesse Stone](:Jesse_Stone_%28character)#Television_adaptations) [television film](:Television_film) series, opposite [Tom Selleck](:Tom_Selleck). He also played Don in the 1992 movie *[Trespass](:Trespass_%281992_film%29)* starring Ice Cube, Ice-T and Bill Paxton."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
