<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Don't_Go_in_the_Woods_(1981_film)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Don't Go in the Woods... Alone!*** (also known as ***Don't Go in the Woods***) is a 1981 American [slasher film](:Slasher_film) directed by James Bryan and written by Garth Eliassen. The film follows four campers confronted by a murderous woodsman slaying hikers on a wooded mountainside. It is one of the infamous \"[video nasties](:Video_nasty)\" banned in the United Kingdom in the 1980s."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
