<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Merlin:_The_Return> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Merlin: The Return is a 2000 British fantasy film written, produced, and directed by Paul Matthews. The film stars Rik Mayall, Patrick Bergin, Craig Sheffer, Adrian Paul, Julie Hartley, and Tia Carrere. The film chronicles the story of Merlin and King Arthur. The film was released in the United Kingdom on 22 December 2000."@en .
