<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Palermo_-_Milan_One_Way> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Palermo - Milan One Way (Italian: Palermo Milano - Solo andata) is a 1995 Italian crime-action film directed by Claudio Fragasso. The film premiered at the 1995 Venice Film Festival. It won the David di Donatello Awards for best sound and for best producer. In 2007 a sequel film, , was released."@en .
