<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Shauna_Macdonald_(Scottish_actress)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Shauna Macdonald** (born 26 April 1981) is a Scottish actress. She began her career starring in *[The Debt Collector](:The_Debt_Collector_%281999_film%29)* (1999). She then had her breakthrough starring as Sam Buxton in the television series *[Spooks](:Spooks_%28TV_series%29)* (2003–2004). After departing the series, she starred as Sarah Carter in the [horror film](:Horror_film) *[The Descent](:The_Descent)* (2005), the role for which she is best known. She gained widespread recognition and praise for her performance, and was nominated for the [Saturn Award for Best Actress](:Saturn_Award_for_Best_Actress). The film established Macdonald as a [scream queen](:Scream_queen). She reprised her role in its sequel *[The Descent Part 2](:The_Descent_Part_2)* (2009).Macdonald has continued having starring roles in horror films, portraying Adelaide in *[Mutant Chronicles](:Mutant_Chronicles_%28film%29)* (2008), Kate in [*Howl*](:Howl_%282015_film%29) (2015), Dana in *[Nails](:Nails_%282017_film%29)* (2017), and Dr. Elle Chrysler in *[White Chamber](:White_Chamber_%28film%29)* (2018), for which she won the Scottish [BAFTA Award for Best Actress](:British_Academy_Scotland_Awards). She is also known for her roles as Carole Robertson in the film [*Filth*](:Filth_%28film%29) (2013), Agnes Muncie in the television series *[In Plain Sight](:In_Plain_Sight_%28British_TV_series%29)* (2016), a pilot in *[Star Wars: The Last Jedi](:Star_Wars%3A_The_Last_Jedi)* (2017), and as psychiatrist Dr. Wallace in the critically acclaimed miniseries *[The Cry](:The_Cry_%28miniseries%29)* (2018). She is the voice of Professor Squawkencluck in the [2015 revival](:Danger_Mouse_%282015_TV_series%29) of the 80s animated television series *[Danger Mouse](:Danger_Mouse_%281981_TV_series%29)* (2015–present).Macdonald is the co-[artistic director](:Artistic_director) of Edinburgh Youth Theatre in [Bellfield](:Bellfield_%28community_centre%29) and has been since 2014. She also teaches [public speaking](:Public_speaking) classes, which she teaches through her own company called If In Doubt Shout."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
