<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Love_Wind_Love_Song> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Love Wind Love Song (Korean: 연풍연가; RR: Yeonpung yeonga) is a 1999 South Korean romance film about a Seoul businessman (Jang Dong-gun) who comes to Jeju Island and meets a lonely tour guide (Ko So-young)."@en .
