<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Alexandre_Desplat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Alexandre Michel Gérard Desplat** (Template:IPA-fr; born 23 August 1961) is a French film composer and conductor. [He has won](:List_of_awards_and_nominations_received_by_Alexandre_Desplat) many awards, including two [Academy Awards](:Academy_Awards), for his musical scores to the films *[The Grand Budapest Hotel](:The_Grand_Budapest_Hotel)* and *[The Shape of Water](:The_Shape_of_Water)*, and has received nine additional [Academy Award](:Academy_Awards) nominations, ten [César](:C%C3%A9sar_Award) nominations (winning three), eleven [BAFTA](:British_Academy_of_Film_and_Television_Arts) nominations (winning three), twelve [Golden Globe Award](:Golden_Globe_Award) nominations (winning two) and ten [Grammy](:Grammy) nominations (winning two).Desplat has composed scores for a wide range of films, including low-budget [independent productions](:Independent_film) and large-scale [blockbusters](:Blockbuster_%28entertainment%29), such as *[The Queen](:The_Queen_%282006_film%29)*, *[The Golden Compass](:The_Golden_Compass_%28film%29)*, *[Mr. Magorium's Wonder Emporium](:Mr%2E_Magorium%27s_Wonder_Emporium)*, *[The Curious Case of Benjamin Button](:The_Curious_Case_of_Benjamin_Button_%28film%29)*, *[The Twilight Saga: New Moon](:The_Twilight_Saga%3A_New_Moon)*, *[Fantastic Mr. Fox](:Fantastic_Mr%2E_Fox_%28film%29)*, *[Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows – Part 1](:Harry_Potter_and_the_Deathly_Hallows_%E2%80%93_Part_1)* *[& Part 2](:Harry_Potter_and_the_Deathly_Hallows_%E2%80%93_Part_2)*, *[Little Women](:Little_Women_%282019_film%29)*, *[The King's Speech](:The_King%27s_Speech)*, *[The Danish Girl](:The_Danish_Girl_%28film%29)*, *[The Imitation Game](:The_Imitation_Game)*, *[Moonrise Kingdom](:Moonrise_Kingdom)*, *[Argo](:Argo_%282012_film%29)*, *[Rise of the Guardians](:Rise_of_the_Guardians)*, *[Zero Dark Thirty](:Zero_Dark_Thirty)*, *[The Midnight Sky](:The_Midnight_Sky)*, *[Godzilla](:Godzilla_%282014_film%29)*, *[Philomena](:Philomena_%28film%29)*, *[Unbroken](:Unbroken_%28film%29)*, *[The Secret Life of Pets](:The_Secret_Life_of_Pets)*, *[Isle of Dogs](:Isle_of_Dogs_%28film%29)*, and *[The French Dispatch](:The_French_Dispatch)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
