<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Patrick_Bergin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Patrick Connolly Bergin (born 4 February 1951) is an Irish actor and singer perhaps best known for his leading role opposite Julia Roberts in Sleeping with the Enemy (1991) and for playing the villainous Aidan Maguire in the BBC soap EastEnders in 2017–2018."@en .
