<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Adnan_Sami> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Adnan Sami Khan (born 15 August 1971) is an Indian singer, musician, music composer and pianist. He performs Indian and Western music, including for Hindi, Kannada, Telugu and Tamil movies. He has been awarded with Padma Shri (India's fourth highest civilian award) for his remarkable contribution in music. His most notable instrument is the piano. He has been credited as \"the first musician to have played the santoor and Indian classical music on the piano\". A review in the US-based Keyboard magazine described him as the fastest keyboard player in the world and called him the keyboard discovery of the nineties."@en .
