<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jon_Harris_(film_editor)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Jon Harris (born 11 July 1967) is a British film editor known for his work on Snatch (2000), Layer Cake (2004), The Descent (2005), Stardust (2007), 127 Hours (2010), The Woman in Black (2012), The Two Faces of January (2014), T2 Trainspotting (2017), McMafia (2018), Yesterday (2019) and The Dig (2021). He was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Film Editing for 127 Hours."@en .
