<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Richard_A._Colla> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Richard A. Colla (born April 18, 1936) (sometimes credited as Dick Colla) is an American film, television director and actor. On screen he played Tony Merritt on the soap opera Days of Our Lives. His directorial credits include The Virginian, Battlestar Galactica, McCloud, Miami Vice, MacGyver, Hunter; Murder, She Wrote; Gunsmoke, Ironside; Trapper John, M.D.; and other series. For much of the 1990s, he directed a number of television films his last credit being Growing Up Brady (2000)."@en .
