<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Molly_Parker> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Molly Parker (born 30 June 1972) is a Canadian actress, writer, and director. She has had roles in independent films as well as television. Her accolades include two Genie Awards, one Independent Spirit Awards nomination, one Primetime Emmy Award nomination, and three nominations for the Screen Actors Guild Award."@en .
