<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Olly_Olly_Oxen_Free_(film)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Olly Olly Oxen Free (also known as The Great Balloon Adventure or The Great Balloon Race) is a 1978 American family adventure film directed by Richard A. Colla and starring Katharine Hepburn. The screenplay by Eugene Poinc is based on a story by Poinc, Colla, and Maria L. de Ossio. The title is derived from \"Olly olly oxen free\" a phrase used in children's games to indicate that those in hiding came out into the open safely and freely."@en .
