<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dunston_Checks_In> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Dunston Checks In*** is a 1996 Canadian-American [children's](:Children%27s_film) [comedy film](:Comedy_film) directed by [Ken Kwapis](:Ken_Kwapis). The film stars [Eric Lloyd](:Eric_Lloyd), Graham Sack, [Jason Alexander](:Jason_Alexander), [Faye Dunaway](:Faye_Dunaway), [Rupert Everett](:Rupert_Everett), [Paul Reubens](:Paul_Reubens), [Glenn Shadix](:Glenn_Shadix), and Sam the Orangutan as Dunston. The film received negative reviews and was a [box office bomb](:Box-office_bomb), only grossing $10 million against a budget of $16 million."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
