<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Holy_Water_(film)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Holy Water*** (later re-named *Hard Times*) is a 2009 Irish [comedy film](:Comedy_film) directed by Tom Reeve and starring [John Lynch](:John_Lynch_%28actor%29), [Linda Hamilton](:Linda_Hamilton), Cornelius Clarke and Lochlainn O'Mearain. It tells the story of a group of men in a rural Irish village who hijack a truck containing [Viagra](:Viagra) with the intention of selling the drug in [Amsterdam](:Amsterdam)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
